  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "At each round opening, a WORLD EATERS army may roll eight D6. Choose at most two different blessings by paying their matching sets. A die pays for one set at most. Discard leftovers and apply the chosen blessings army-wide through that round. Unbridled Bloodlust accepts any pair. Boost charge rolls by 1. Rage-Fuelled Invigoration needs a pair showing 2 or better and sets a 6-inch limit for each model’s Pile-in and Consolidation moves, replacing the usual 3. Total Carnage takes a pair of 3 or higher. When a melee attack kills a model that hasn’t fought this phase, a D6 result of 4+ delays removal. The model may fight after the attacker finishes, then comes off the table. Martial Excellence takes a pair of 4 or higher or any triple, adding [SUSTAINED HITS 1] to melee weapons. Warp Blades takes a pair of 5 or higher or a triple of 2 or higher, giving those weapons [LETHAL HITS]. Decapitating Strikes costs two sixes or a triple of 3 or better and grants [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] to melee attacks against INFANTRY.",
